{"Feature-flag mismatch: registerListener uses ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ while evaluators/management use ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ_V2, causing the provider event listener to not be active when V2 is enabled but V1 is not": 0.9245825409889221, "V1 ClientPermissions creates per-client resources named 'client.resource.<id>' with type 'Client', while V2 ClientPermissionsV2 looks up resources by client.getId() under type 'Clients', causing permission evaluations to silently miss": 0.44789159297943115, "ClientPermissionsV2 throws UnsupportedOperationException for interface methods (e.g. setPermissionsEnabled, isPermissionsEnabled, mapRolesPermission) that callers may invoke at runtime, causing hard failures": 0.8649999499320984, "Missing null-check in ClientPermissionsV2.hasPermission(ClientModel, scope) - AdminPermissionsSchema.getResourceTypeResource(...) can return null, and passing null resource into PolicyStore.findByResource(server, resource) will trigger NullPointerException": 0.9679079055786133}